* Alternative: two-path feedforward CTLE, a different topology from the reference. A flat path (npn13G2 pair
* QA, about 3 mA per side, resistive emitter degeneration switched by the gain code) and a high-pass path
* (npn13G2 pair QB, about 3.5 mA per side, emitters joined only by a series R-C network whose capacitors the
* peak code switches with hv NMOS switches at the differential virtual ground) drive the same loads, so their
* collector currents add. No varactors and no capacitive degeneration of the flat path. DC-coupled input, tails,
* load and CMFB as in the reference.
.subckt ctle_28g vss vdd iref vocm vinp vinn gain_b0 gain_b1 peak_b0 peak_b1 voutp voutn
XREF iref iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=6u l=0.5u ng=1
XTAP tap iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=180u l=0.5u ng=18
XTACP eap vcg tap vss sg13_lv_nmos w=40u l=0.13u ng=8
XTAN tan iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=180u l=0.5u ng=18
XTACN ean vcg tan vss sg13_lv_nmos w=40u l=0.13u ng=8
XTBP tbp iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=210u l=0.5u ng=21
XTBCP ebp vcg tbp vss sg13_lv_nmos w=60u l=0.13u ng=12
XTBN tbn iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=210u l=0.5u ng=21
XTBCN ebn vcg tbn vss sg13_lv_nmos w=60u l=0.13u ng=12
XBN xbn iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=6u l=0.5u ng=1
XBC pbd vocm xbn vss sg13_hv_nmos w=4u l=0.45u ng=1
XBPD pbd pbd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XBPC vcg pbd vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XCREP vcg vcg vcs vss sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1
RCB vcs vss 3.5k
CCG vcg vss 10p
RTP vinp vocm 50
RTN vinn vocm 50
XQAP cp vinp eap vss npn13G2 Nx=4
XQAN cn vinn ean vss npn13G2 Nx=4
XQBP cp vinp ebp vss npn13G2 Nx=6
XQBN cn vinn ebn vss npn13G2 Nx=6
LPP vddi xp 0.25n
RLP xp cp 45
LOP cp voutn 0.2n
LPN vddi xn 0.25n
RLN xn cn 45
LON cn voutp 0.2n
RS0 eap ean 327
RG1A eap g1a 549
XG1A g1a gain_b1 g1b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
XG1B g1a gain_b0 g1b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
RG1B g1b ean 549
RG2A eap g2a 409
XG2 g2a gain_b1 g2b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=20u l=0.45u ng=4
RG2B g2b ean 409
RG3A eap g3a 287
XG3A g3a gain_b1 g3m vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
XG3B g3m gain_b0 g3b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
RG3M g3m vss 1meg
RG3B g3b ean 287
RB0 ebp m0 5
CB0 m0 ebn 10f
CP1A ebp p1a 65f
XP1A p1a peak_b1 p1b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
XP1B p1a peak_b0 p1b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
CP1B p1b ebn 65f
RP1A p1a vss 20k
RP1B p1b vss 20k
CP2A ebp p2a 92f
XP2 p2a peak_b1 p2b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=40u l=0.45u ng=8
CP2B p2b ebn 92f
RP2A p2a vss 20k
RP2B p2b vss 20k
CP3A ebp p3a 165f
XP3A p3a peak_b1 p3m vss sg13_hv_nmos w=80u l=0.45u ng=16
XP3B p3m peak_b0 p3b vss sg13_hv_nmos w=80u l=0.45u ng=16
RP3M p3m vss 1meg
CP3B p3b ebn 165f
RP3A p3a vss 20k
RP3B p3b vss 20k
RCP voutp cms 10k
RCN voutn cms 10k
XE1 ea1 cms et vss sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XE2 ea2 vocm et vss sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XEP1 ea1 ea1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XEP2 ea2 ea1 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=10u l=0.5u ng=2
XET et iref vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=12u l=0.5u ng=2
CCMP ea2 vdd 2p
XPASS vddi ea2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=200u l=0.4u ng=40 m=4
CVDDI vddi vss 20p
.ends ctle_28g
